d Dhoni hit the winning six in the 2011 final?"},"options":[{"en":"Lasith Malinga"},{"en":"Nuwan Kulasekara"},{"en":"Thisara Perera"},{"en":"Muttiah Muralitharan"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"India 2011","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Kulasekara bowled the 49th over; Jayawardene had earlier made 103 not out for Sri Lanka."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.outlookindia.com/sports/cricket/on-this-day-april-2-2011-ms-dhoni-india-icc-world-cup-victory"},{"id":"cr039","prompt":{"en":"Why was the coin toss for the 2011 World Cup final taken twice?"},"options":[{"en":"Referee Jeff Crowe couldn't hear Sangakkara's call over the crowd"},{"en":"The coin landed on its edge"},{"en":"The wrong commemorative coin was used"},{"en":"Both captains claimed to have won"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"India 2011","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Sri Lanka won the retaken toss and batted; Dilshan (500) was the tournament's top scorer."},"sourceUrl":"https://gulfnews.com/sport/cricket/icc/flashback-2011-cricket-world-cup-1.64225347"},{"id":"cr040","prompt":{"en":"Which franchise won the inaugural IPL in 2008, beating Chennai Super Kings in the final?"},"options":[{"en":"Chennai Super Kings"},{"en":"Rajasthan Royals"},{"en":"Kolkata Knight Riders"},{"en":"Deccan Chargers"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"IPL","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"The cheapest franchise at auction won by three wickets; Sohail Tanvir's 6 for 14 that season stood as the IPL's best figures until 2019."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.crictracker.com/ipl-the-first-ever-happenings-in-the-history-of-the-tournament/"},{"id":"cr041","prompt":{"en":"Who blasted an unbeaten 158 for Kolkata Knight Riders in the very first IPL match on 18 April 2008?"},"options":[{"en":"Chris Gayle"},{"en":"Adam Gilchrist"},{"en":"Brendon McCullum"},{"en":"Virender Sehwag"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"IPL","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"McCullum faced 73 balls against Royal Challengers Bangalore and was on nought after his first eight."},"sourceUrl":"https://gulfnews.com/sport/cricket/ipl/on-this-day-mccullum-blasted-unbeaten-158-for-kolkata-exactly-15-years-ago-to-give-ipl-dream-start-1.87260480"},{"id":"cr042","prompt":{"en":"Which two IPL seasons did Chennai Super Kings and Rajasthan Royals sit out after the Lodha committee suspended them?"},"options":[{"en":"2014 and 2015"},{"en":"2015 and 2016"},{"en":"2016 and 2017"},{"en":"2017 and 2018"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"IPL","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"The July 2015 verdict followed the 2013 spot-fixing arrests; officials Meiyappan and Kundra were banned for life."},"sourceUrl":"https://gulfnews.com/sport/cricket/ipl/csk-and-rajasthan-to-serve-two-year-suspensions-1.1602573"},{"id":"cr043","prompt":{"en":"Who bowled the first ball in IPL history, to Sourav Ganguly in Bangalore in 2008?"},"options":[{"en":"Praveen Kumar"},{"en":"Zaheer Khan"},{"en":"Ishant Sharma"},{"en":"Ashley Noffke"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"IPL","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"McCullum then hit the first four and first six of the league in the second over."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.crictracker.com/ipl-the-first-ever-happenings-in-the-history-of-the-tournament/"},{"id":"cr045","prompt":{"en":"How many international centuries did Sachin Tendulkar finish with across all formats?"},"options":[{"en":"95"},{"en":"100"},{"en":"105"},{"en":"110"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Tendulkar v Lara","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"51 in Tests and 49 in ODIs; the hundredth came in his penultimate ODI in 2012."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.icc-cricket.com/hall-of-fame/hall-of-famers/hall-of-famer-sachin-tendulkar"},{"id":"cr046","prompt":{"en":"Against which team did Brian Lara make his 400 not out in Antigua in 2004, Test cricket's only quadruple century?"},"options":[{"en":"England"},{"en":"Australia"},{"en":"South Africa"},{"en":"India"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Tendulkar v Lara","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Lara is the only player to have broken the Test highest-score record twice, with 375 and then 400."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.icc-cricket.com/hall-of-fame/hall-of-famers/hall-of-famer-brian-lara"},{"id":"cr047","prompt":{"en":"Whose 36-year-old record did Lara's 375 in 1994 break?"},"options":[{"en":"Garfield Sobers's"},{"en":"Len Hutton's"},{"en":"Hanif Mohammad's"},{"en":"Don Bradman's"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Tendulkar v Lara","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Sobers's 365 not out had stood since 1958; Lara later became the only man to break the record twice."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.icc-cricket.com/hall-of-fame/hall-of-famers/hall-of-famer-brian-lara"},{"id":"cr048","prompt":{"en":"In which city did Tendulkar make the first men's ODI double century, against South Africa in February 2010?"},"options":[{"en":"Gwalior"},{"en":"Nagpur"},{"en":"Indore"},{"en":"Rajkot"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Tendulkar v Lara","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"He reached 200 with a single off Charl Langeveldt in the last over; India made 401 for 3."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2010/2/24/tendulkar-breaks-one-day-record"},{"id":"cr049","prompt":{"en":"Which Zimbabwean shared the ODI record of 194 that Tendulkar's 200 not out overtook?"},"options":[{"en":"Charles Coventry"},{"en":"Andy Flower"},{"en":"Grant Flower"},{"en":"Brendan Taylor"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Tendulkar v Lara","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Coventry had equalled Saeed Anwar's 1997 mark against Bangladesh in Bulawayo the previous August."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2010/2/24/tendulkar-breaks-one-day-record"},{"id":"cr050","prompt":{"en":"Which Australian did Vinoo Mankad run out at the non-striker's end on 13 December 1947, giving the dismissal its name?"},"options":[{"en":"Sid Barnes"},{"en":"Arthur Morris"},{"en":"Lindsay Hassett"},{"en":"Bill Brown"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Mankading and the Laws","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Don Bradman, the Australian captain, defended Mankad: the Laws say the non-striker must stay in his ground."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.wionews.com/sports/1947-when-real-vinoo-mankad-mankaded-australian-batsman-bill-brown-205811"},{"id":"cr051","prompt":{"en":"Under the current Laws of Cricket, running out a non-striker who leaves early sits in which Law?"},"options":[{"en":"Law 38 (Run out)"},{"en":"Law 41 (Unfair play)"},{"en":"Law 42 (Players' conduct)"},{"en":"Law 24 (Fielder's absence)"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Mankading and the Laws","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Law 38.3 makes the non-striker liable until the bowler's arm reaches the top of the delivery swing."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.lords.org/mcc/the-laws/run-out"},{"id":"cr052","prompt":{"en":"In MCC's 2022 Code, the non-striker run-out was moved into Law