n became the first Indian to score a century in each innings of a Test, with 116 and 145 at Adelaide in 1947-48?"},"options":[{"en":"Vijay Merchant"},{"en":"Lala Amarnath"},{"en":"Vijay Hazare"},{"en":"Vinoo Mankad"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Vijay Hazare","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Australia won that series 4-0 and Bradman made 715 runs at 178.75 in his final home series."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vijay_Hazare"},{"id":"cr119","prompt":{"en":"With whom did Vijay Hazare add 577 for Baroda against Holkar in the 1946-47 Ranji Trophy final, a first-class partnership record for any wicket that stood for decades?"},"options":[{"en":"Gul Mohammad"},{"en":"Hemu Adhikari"},{"en":"C. S. Nayudu"},{"en":"Mushtaq Ali"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Vijay Hazare","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Gul Mohammad made 319 in that innings and later played a Test for Pakistan as well as eight for India."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Gul_Mohammad"},{"id":"cr120","prompt":{"en":"Which Indian batsman retired with a first-class average of 71.64, second only to Don Bradman among players with substantial careers?"},"options":[{"en":"Vijay Hazare"},{"en":"C. K. Nayudu"},{"en":"Mushtaq Ali"},{"en":"Vijay Merchant"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Vijay Merchant","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Merchant scored 2,385 runs at 74.53 on the 1946 tour of England and made 154 in his final Test, at Delhi in 1951, aged 40."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Vijay_Merchant"},{"id":"cr121","prompt":{"en":"Who scored India's first Test century abroad, 112 against England at Old Trafford in 1936?"},"options":[{"en":"Vijay Merchant"},{"en":"C. K. Nayudu"},{"en":"Mushtaq A