ld Cup, with 18 wickets?"},"options":[{"en":"Madan Lal"},{"en":"Kapil Dev"},{"en":"Roger Binny"},{"en":"Balwinder Sandhu"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"1983 World Cup","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Madan Lal was next with 17, level with Sri Lanka's Ashantha de Mel."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1983_Cricket_World_Cup"},{"id":"cr175","prompt":{"en":"Who top-scored for India with 38 in the 1983 World Cup final?"},"options":[{"en":"Mohinder Amarnath"},{"en":"Sandeep Patil"},{"en":"Yashpal Sharma"},{"en":"Krishnamachari Srikkanth"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"1983 World Cup","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Andy Roberts took 3 for 32 and Kapil Dev made 15 off eight balls as India were bowled out in 54.4 overs."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1983_Cricket_World_Cup_final"},{"id":"cr176","prompt":{"en":"Where did India beat England in the semi-final of the 1983 World Cup?"},"options":[{"en":"Edgbaston"},{"en":"Old Trafford"},{"en":"The Oval"},{"en":"Headingley"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"1983 World Cup","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"England made 213 and India reached 217 for 4 in 54.4 overs, with Yashpal Sharma making 61 and Sandeep Patil 51 off 32 balls."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1983_Cricket_World_Cup"},{"id":"cr177","prompt":{"en":"Who kept wicket for India in the 1983 World Cup final and was named the best wicketkeeper of the tournament?"},"options":[{"en":"Kiran More"},{"en":"Chandrakant Pandit"},{"en":"Bharath Reddy"},{"en":"Syed Kirmani"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Syed Kirmani","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"He played 88 T