yan Ojha"},{"en":"Harbhajan Singh"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Mohali 2010","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Laxman finished on 73 not out chasing 216, and Ojha helped him add the last 11 runs after Ishant fell for 31."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_cricket_team_in_India_in_2010%E2%80%9311"},{"id":"cr350","prompt":{"en":"MS Dhoni retired from Test cricket with immediate effect in December 2014 after a drawn Test at which ground?"},"options":[{"en":"Sydney Cricket Ground"},{"en":"Melbourne Cricket Ground"},{"en":"Adelaide Oval"},{"en":"The Gabba"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Dhoni's Test retirement","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"The BCCI broke the news on 30 December 2014, minutes after Dhoni had faced reporters without mentioning it; he cited the strain of playing all formats."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2014/12/30/indias-dhoni-retires-from-test-cricket"},{"id":"cr351","prompt":{"en":"Who captained India in the Sydney Test of January 2015, the first after Dhoni quit the format?"},"options":[{"en":"Ajinkya Rahane"},{"en":"Murali Vijay"},{"en":"R Ashwin"},{"en":"Virat Kohli"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Dhoni's Test retirement","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Dhoni had led India in 60 Tests with a 45 per cent win rate, the best of any Indian captain with at least five matches in charge at the time."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2014/12/30/indias-dhoni-retires-from-test-cricket"},{"id":"cr352","prompt":{"en":"How many runs did Virat Kohli score in the four-Test series in Australia in 2014-15?"},"options":[{"en":"692"},{"en":"588"},{"en":"741"},{"en":"654"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2014-15","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Kohli made four centuries in the series, the most runs by an Indian batsman in a Test series in Australia, yet Australia won 2-0 with two draws."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_Australia_in_2014%E2%80%9315"},{"id":"cr353","prompt":{"en":"Which pair of scores did Kohli make in the Adelaide Test of December 2014, his first match as stand-in captain?"},"options":[{"en":"103 and 128"},{"en":"119 and 96"},{"en":"115 and 141"},{"en":"141 and 169"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2014-15","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Chasing 364 on the final day, India were bowled out for 315 as Nathan Lyon took 7 for 152 and finished with ten wickets in the match."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_Australia_in_2014%E2%80%9315"},{"id":"cr354","prompt":{"en":"Who was player of the series with 769 runs when Australia beat India 2-0 in 2014-15?"},"options":[{"en":"David Warner"},{"en":"Steven Smith"},{"en":"Nathan Lyon"},{"en":"Mitchell Johnson"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2014-15","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Smith made a century in every Test of the series, equalling a record shared by Don Bradman and Jacques Kallis."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_Australia_in_2014%E2%80%9315"},{"id":"cr355","prompt":{"en":"India's defence of the World Cup ended in a 95-run semi-final defeat to Australia in March 2015 at which ground?"},"options":[{"en":"Sydney Cricket Ground"},{"en":"Melbourne Cricket Ground"},{"en":"Eden Park"},{"en":"Adelaide Oval"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2015 World Cup","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Australia made 328 for 7 and India were bowled out for 233; Australia then beat New Zealand in the final at the MCG."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.espncricinfo.com/series/icc-cricket-world-cup-2014-15-509587/australia-vs-india-2nd-semi-final-656493/match-report"},{"id":"cr356","prompt":{"en":"Who top-scored for India with 65 in the 2015 World Cup semi-final against Australia?"},"options":[{"en":"Shikhar Dhawan"},{"en":"Rohit Sharma"},{"en":"MS Dhoni"},{"en":"Suresh Raina"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2015 World Cup","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Steven Smith made 105 off 93 balls for Australia, his fourth ODI century, while Umesh Yadav took 4 for 72 for India."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.espncricinfo.com/series/icc-cricket-world-cup-2014-15-509587/australia-vs-india-2nd-semi-final-656493/match-report"},{"id":"cr357","prompt":{"en":"Kohli's unbeaten 82 off 51 balls at Mohali in the 2016 World T20, which he later called his best T20 innings, came against which side?"},"options":[{"en":"Australia"},{"en":"Pakistan"},{"en":"New Zealand"},{"en":"West Indies"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2016 World T20","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"India chased 161 with five balls to spare on 27 March 2016 and the win sent them into a semi-final against West Indies."},"sourceUrl":"https://royalchallengers.com/rcb-cricket-news/news/on-this-day-in-2016-kohlis-breathtaking-innings-takes-india-to-the-semis"},{"id":"cr358","prompt":{"en":"How many runs did India still need from the last 18 balls at Mohali in 2016 before Kohli took the chase apart?"},"options":[{"en":"45"},{"en":"33"},{"en":"39"},{"en":"52"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2016 World T20","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Kohli took 19 off James Faulkner and then four boundaries in a row off Nathan Coulter-Nile, leaving four to get in the last over, which Dhoni finished."},"sourceUrl":"https://royalchallengers.com/rcb-cricket-news/news/on-this-day-in-2016-kohlis-breathtaking-innings-takes-india-to-the-semis"},{"id":"cr359","prompt":{"en":"For what total were India bowled out by New Zealand at Nagpur in their opening Super 10 match of the 2016 World T20?"},"options":[{"en":"92"},{"en":"85"},{"en":"101"},{"en":"79"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2016 World T20","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Chasing 127, India lost by 47 runs as Mitchell Santner took 4 for 11 and Ish Sodhi 3 for 18; only Dhoni (30) and Kohli (23) reached 20."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.icc-cricket.com/tournaments/mens-t20-world-cup-2026/news/looking-back-previous-india-v-new-zealand-t20-world-cup-matches"},{"id":"cr360","prompt":{"en":"Who bowled the final over when India beat Bangladesh by one run at Bangalore in the 2016 World T20?"},"options":[{"en":"Jasprit Bumrah"},{"en":"Hardik Pandya"},{"en":"Ashish Nehra"},{"en":"R Ashwin"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2016 World T20","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Defending 146 for 7, India took three wickets in the last three balls after Bangladesh had needed two from the final delivery."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.dnaindia.com/cricket/report-throwback-watch-when-ms-dhoni-eliminated-bangladesh-out-of-2016-world-cup-with-epic-last-ball-run-out-2998079"},{"id":"cr361","prompt":{"en":"Which Bangladesh batsman was run out by Dhoni off the last ball of the one-run thriller at Bangalore in March 2016?"},"options":[{"en":"Mahmudullah"},{"en":"Mushfiqur Rahim"},{"en":"Mustafizur Rahman"},{"en":"Shuvagata Hom"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2016 World T20","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Dhoni had already pulled off one glove before the ball was bowled, then sprinted to the stumps himself; Mushfiqur and Mahmudullah had fallen to the two previous deliveries."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.dnaindia.com/cricket/report-throwback-watch-when-ms-dhoni-eliminated-bangladesh-out-of-2016-world-cup-with-epic-last-ball-run-out-2998079"},{"id":"cr362","prompt":{"en":"Who was named player of the tournament at the 2016 World T20 in India after scoring 273 runs?"},"options":[{"en":"Tamim Iqbal"},{"en":"Carlos Brathwaite"},{"en":"Mohammad Nabi"},{"en":"Virat Kohli"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2016 World T20","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"West Indies beat England by four wickets in the final at Eden Gardens; Tamim Iqbal topped the run charts with 295 and Nabi the wickets with 12."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2016_ICC_World_Twenty20"},{"id":"cr363","prompt":{"en":"Which India head coach resigned in June 2017, calling his partnership with captain Kohli 'untenable'?"},"options":[{"en":"Anil Kumble"},{"en":"Duncan Fletcher"},{"en":"Ravi Shastri"},{"en":"Sanjay Bangar"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Kumble-Kohli rift","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"He stepped down on 20 June 2017, two days after the Champions Trophy final, having overseen a 19-match unbeaten home Test streak."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anil_Kumble"},{"id":"cr364","prompt":{"en":"Which event was Anil Kumble's last as India head coach?"},"options":[{"en":"The 2016 World T20"},{"en":"The 2017 tour of the West Indies"},{"en":"The 2017 Champions Trophy"},{"en":"The 2017 tour of Sri Lanka"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Kumble-Kohli rift","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Kumble had been appointed on a one-year term on 24 June 2016 and India lost the Champions Trophy final to Pakistan at The Oval."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Anil_Kumble"},{"id":"cr365","prompt":{"en":"Which three former players made up the Cricket Advisory Committee that appointed Ravi Shastri head coach in July 2017?"},"options":[{"en":"Rahul Dravid, Anil Kumble and Javagal Srinath"},{"en":"Sunil Gavaskar, Kapil Dev and Dilip Vengsarkar"},{"en":"Sourav Ganguly, Rahul Dravid and VVS Laxman"},{"en":"Sourav Ganguly, Sachin Tendulkar and VVS Laxman"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Ravi Shastri","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Shastri succeeded Kumble on a reported Rs 8 crore a year and was reappointed in August 2019 through to the 2021 T20 World Cup."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravi_Shastri"},{"id":"cr366","prompt":{"en":"What title did Ravi Shastri hold with the India team from August 2014 until 2016, before he became head coach?"},"options":[{"en":"Team director"},{"en":"Batting consultant"},{"en":"Chairman of selectors"},{"en":"Team manager"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Ravi Shastri","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"Shastri's coaching tenure ended in November 2021 after the T20 World Cup, after which he became commissioner of the Legends League Cricket."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravi_Shastri"},{"id":"cr367","prompt":{"en":"Whose 114 set up Pakistan's 180-run win over India in the 2017 Champions Trophy final at The Oval?"},"options":[{"en":"Babar Azam"},{"en":"Fakhar Zaman"},{"en":"Mohammad Hafeez"},{"en":"Azhar Ali"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2017 Champions Trophy","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"It was his maiden ODI century; Pakistan had entered the tournament ranked eighth and the margin remains the largest in an ICC ODI final."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_ICC_Champions_Trophy_final"},{"id":"cr368","prompt":{"en":"Whose no-ball reprieved Fakhar Zaman on 3 in the 2017 Champions Trophy final?"},"options":[{"en":"Bhuvneshwar Kumar"},{"en":"Hardik Pandya"},{"en":"Jasprit Bumrah"},{"en":"R Ashwin"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2017 Champions Trophy","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Fakhar had been given out, but the overstep was called and he went on to 114 off 106 balls as Pakistan posted 338 for 4."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_ICC_Champions_Trophy_final"},{"id":"cr369","prompt":{"en":"Which Pakistan bowler dismissed Rohit Sharma, Virat Kohli and Shikhar Dhawan in the 2017 Champions Trophy final?"},"options":[{"en":"Mohammad Amir"},{"en":"Hasan Ali"},{"en":"Junaid Khan"},{"en":"Shadab Khan"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2017 Champions Trophy","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"His 3 for 16 from six overs wrecked the chase as India were bowled out for 158; Hasan Ali took the Golden Ball with 13 wickets and was player of the tournament."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_ICC_Champions_Trophy_final"},{"id":"cr370","prompt":{"en":"How did Hardik Pandya's 76 off 43 balls end in the 2017 Champions Trophy final?"},"options":[{"en":"Caught in the deep"},{"en":"Bowled"},{"en":"Stumped"},{"en":"Run out"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"2017 Champions Trophy","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Pandya was run out during a partnership with Ravindra Jadeja, and India folded for 158 in 30.3 overs."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2017_ICC_Champions_Trophy_final"},{"id":"cr371","prompt":{"en":"Kohli reached 10,000 ODI runs against West Indies in October 2018 in how many innings, beating Tendulkar's 259?"},"options":[{"en":"213"},{"en":"198"},{"en":"205"},{"en":"220"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Kohli's ODI records","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"He scored 453 runs in that five-match series, which India won 3-1 with one tie, and was player of the series."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/West_Indian_cricket_team_in_India_in_2018%E2%80%9319"},{"id":"cr372","prompt":{"en":"Against which side did Kohli's unbeaten 111 in July 2017 take him past Tendulkar's record for the most ODI centuries in run chases?"},"options":[{"en":"West Indies"},{"en":"Sri Lanka"},{"en":"New Zealand"},{"en":"England"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Kohli's ODI records","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"It was his 18th ODI century while chasing, one more than Tendulkar, and it came at Kingston in the fifth match of a series India won 3-1."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_the_West_Indies_in_2017"},{"id":"cr373","prompt":{"en":"At which ground did Jasprit Bumrah make his Test debut in January 2018?"},"options":[{"en":"Cape Town"},{"en":"Centurion"},{"en":"Johannesburg"},{"en":"Durban"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"South Africa 2018","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"South Africa won that Newlands Test by 72 runs; Wriddhiman Saha took ten catches in the match for India."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_South_Africa_in_2017%E2%80%9318"},{"id":"cr374","prompt":{"en":"Kohli's 153 in the 2018 Test series in South Africa came at which venue?"},"options":[{"en":"Cape Town"},{"en":"Johannesburg"},{"en":"Centurion"},{"en":"Port Elizabeth"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"South Africa 2018","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"South Africa still won that second Test by 135 runs to take the series, with Lungi Ngidi impressive on debut."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_South_Africa_in_2017%E2%80%9318"},{"id":"cr375","prompt":{"en":"Who was player of the match in India's 63-run win at the Wanderers in January 2018?"},"options":[{"en":"Jasprit Bumrah"},{"en":"Bhuvneshwar Kumar"},{"en":"Mohammed Shami"},{"en":"Virat Kohli"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"South Africa 2018","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Bumrah took his first Test five-wicket haul in the same match; India then won the ODI series 5-1 with Kohli scoring 558 runs."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_South_Africa_in_2017%E2%80%9318"},{"id":"cr376","prompt":{"en":"How many Test runs did Kohli score on the 2018 tour of England, where India lost the series 4-1?"},"options":[{"en":"480"},{"en":"655"},{"en":"521"},{"en":"593"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"England 2018","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"He made 149 and 51 at Edgbaston and 97 and 103 at Trent Bridge; James Anderson took 24 wickets for England."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_England_in_2018"},{"id":"cr377","prompt":{"en":"At which ground did India record their only win of the 2018 Test series in England, by 203 runs?"},"options":[{"en":"Lord's"},{"en":"Trent Bridge"},{"en":"The Rose Bowl"},{"en":"The Oval"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"England 2018","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"England had won by an innings and 159 runs at Lord's earlier in the series; Pujara's unbeaten 132 at Southampton could not prevent a 60-run defeat next."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_England_in_2018"},{"id":"cr378","prompt":{"en":"Which England player shared the player of the series award with Kohli in 2018?"},"options":[{"en":"James Anderson"},{"en":"Ben Stokes"},{"en":"Sam Curran"},{"en":"Joe Root"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"England 2018","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Alastair Cook signed off with 147 at The Oval, becoming only the fifth batsman to score a century in both his first and last Tests."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_England_in_2018"},{"id":"cr379","prompt":{"en":"Which Indian wicketkeeper scored 114 at The Oval in 2018, the first Test century by an Indian keeper in England?"},"options":[{"en":"Wriddhiman Saha"},{"en":"Dinesh Karthik"},{"en":"Parthiv Patel"},{"en":"Rishabh Pant"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Rishabh Pant","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"He had made his Test debut at Trent Bridge earlier in the series and got off the mark in Test cricket with a six."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Rishabh_Pant"},{"id":"cr380","prompt":{"en":"What was the result of India's 2018-19 Test series in Australia, their first series win in that country?"},"options":[{"en":"3-1"},{"en":"2-1"},{"en":"2-0"},{"en":"3-0"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2018-19","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"India won at Adelaide and Melbourne, lost at Perth and drew a rain-hit Sydney Test to become the first Asian side to win a Test series in Australia."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_Australia_in_2018%E2%80%9319"},{"id":"cr381","prompt":{"en":"How many centuries did Cheteshwar Pujara make on the way to 521 runs in the 2018-19 series in Australia?"},"options":[{"en":"Two"},{"en":"Four"},{"en":"Three"},{"en":"One"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2018-19","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"He made 123 at Adelaide, 106 at Melbourne and 193 at Sydney and was named player of the series."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_Australia_in_2018%E2%80%9319"},{"id":"cr382","prompt":{"en":"Which Indian took 6 for 33 in the first innings of the 2018 Boxing Day Test at Melbourne?"},"options":[{"en":"Ishant Sharma"},{"en":"Mohammed Shami"},{"en":"R Ashwin"},{"en":"Jasprit Bumrah"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2018-19","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"India won by 137 runs to go 2-1 up; he and Nathan Lyon each finished the series with 21 wickets."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Indian_cricket_team_in_Australia_in_2018%E2%80%9319"},{"id":"cr383","prompt":{"en":"Which Australia captain's 'can you babysit' jab at Rishabh Pant was picked up by the stump microphones in the 2018 Boxing Day Test?"},"options":[{"en":"Aaron Finch"},{"en":"Tim Paine"},{"en":"Steve Smith"},{"en":"Pat Cummins"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia 2018-19","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Pant shot back with 'have you heard of a temporary captain ever', and days later Bonnie Paine posted a photo of him with her children captioned 'best babysitter'."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.cricket.