mmed Shami"},{"en":"Jasprit Bumrah"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"First day-night Test","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Kohli's 136 was the first pink-ball Test century by an Indian, and Bangladesh became the first side to use two concussion substitutes in one Test."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Bangladeshi_cricket_team_in_India_in_2019%E2%80%9320"},{"id":"cr394","prompt":{"en":"Who scored 303 not out against England at Chennai in December 2016, in only his third Test?"},"options":[{"en":"Cheteshwar Pujara"},{"en":"KL Rahul"},{"en":"Murali Vijay"},{"en":"Karun Nair"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"England 2016","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"He became the second Indian after Virender Sehwag to make a Test triple century, and the first to convert a maiden hundred into one."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Karun_Nair"},{"id":"cr395","prompt":{"en":"In which city did Kohli make 235, then the highest Test score by an Indian against England, in December 2016?"},"options":[{"en":"Mumbai"},{"en":"Chennai"},{"en":"Visakhapatnam"},{"en":"Mohali"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"England 2016","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"India won that fourth Test by an innings and 36 runs and took the series 4-0; Kohli finished with 655 runs and Ashwin with 28 wickets."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/English_cricket_team_in_India_in_2016%E2%80%9317"},{"id":"cr396","prompt":{"en":"In how many Tests did R Ashwin reach 300 wickets in 2017, beating Dennis Lillee's record of 56?"},"options":[{"en":"56"},{"en":"54"},{"en":"51"},{"en":"58"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Ashwin and Jadeja","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"Ashwin was the ICC Cricketer of the Year for 2016 and finished his career with 11 Test player-of-the-series awards, level with Muttiah Muralitharan."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravichandran_Ashwin"},{"id":"cr397","prompt":{"en":"Which Australian spinner took 12 for 70 at Pune in February 2017, the best figures by a visiting spinner in a Test in India?"},"options":[{"en":"Nathan Lyon"},{"en":"Mitchell Starc"},{"en":"Josh Hazlewood"},{"en":"Steve O'Keefe"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Australia in India 2017","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"Australia won that Test by 333 runs, but India came back to take the series 2-1 with Jadeja named player of the series for 25 wickets."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Australian_cricket_team_in_India_in_2016%E2%80%9317"},{"id":"cr398","prompt":{"en":"On which date did MS Dhoni announce his retirement from international cricket with an Instagram post?"},"options":[{"en":"10 July 2019"},{"en":"1 January 2020"},{"en":"15 August 2020"},{"en":"26 January 2021"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Dhoni's retirement","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":2,"explanation":{"en":"Suresh Raina announced his own retirement the same evening, writing that he had chosen 'to join you in this journey'."},"sourceUrl":"https://www.aljazeera.com/sports/2020/8/15/ms-dhoni-ex-india-cricket-captain-says-consider-me-as-retired"},{"id":"cr399","prompt":{"en":"From what time on 15 August 2020 did Dhoni's Instagram post ask fans to 'consider me as retired'?"},"options":[{"en":"19:29"},{"en":"20:00"},{"en":"18:45"},{"en":"21:15"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Dhoni's retirement","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"The post carried a