e hundreds; the match was drawn."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/South_African_cricket_team_in_India_in_2007%E2%80%9308"},{"id":"cr572","prompt":{"en":"Against which team did Virat Kohli score his 50th ODI century, passing Sachin Tendulkar's record, at the Wankhede in November 2023?"},"options":[{"en":"New Zealand"},{"en":"South Africa"},{"en":"Australia"},{"en":"Sri Lanka"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Virat Kohli","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"The 117 came in the World Cup semi-final on 15 November 2023; his first ODI hundred had been 107 against Sri Lanka at Eden Gardens in 2009."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_international_cricket_centuries_by_Virat_Kohli"},{"id":"cr573","prompt":{"en":"After his 124 against New Zealand at Indore on 18 January 2026, how many international centuries did Virat Kohli have?"},"options":[{"en":"82"},{"en":"85"},{"en":"88"},{"en":"91"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Virat Kohli","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"The tally was 30 in Tests, 54 in ODIs and one in T20Is, second only to Tendulkar's 100; he had retired from Tests in May 2025."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_international_cricket_centuries_by_Virat_Kohli"},{"id":"cr574","prompt":{"en":"In which tournament did Sachin Tendulkar finally reach his 100th international century, in March 2012?"},"options":[{"en":"World Cup"},{"en":"Asia Cup"},{"en":"Champions Trophy"},{"en":"Commonwealth Bank Series"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Sachin Tendulkar","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"He made 114 against Bangladesh at Mirpur on 16 March 2012 and India still lost; the tally was 51 Test and 49 ODI hundreds."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_international_cricket_centuries_by_Sachin_Tendulkar"},{"id":"cr575","prompt":{"en":"In how many Tests did Anil Kumble take his 619 wickets, the most by an Indian?"},"options":[{"en":"132"},{"en":"118"},{"en":"141"},{"en":"125"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"Anil Kumble","difficulty":"expert","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":0,"explanation":{"en":"He took 35 Test five-wicket hauls and 337 ODI wickets, including 6 for 12 against West Indies in the 1993 Hero Cup final."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_international_cricket_five-wicket_hauls_by_Anil_Kumble"},{"id":"cr576","prompt":{"en":"With how many Test wickets did R Ashwin retire from international cricket in December 2024?"},"options":[{"en":"487"},{"en":"537"},{"en":"561"},{"en":"602"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"R Ashwin","difficulty":"simple","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":1,"explanation":{"en":"He announced it in Brisbane mid-series after 106 Tests, second only to Kumble for India, and also scored six Test centuries."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravichandran_Ashwin"},{"id":"cr577","prompt":{"en":"How many Test five-wicket hauls did R Ashwin finish with, the second-most in the history of the format?"},"options":[{"en":"29"},{"en":"33"},{"en":"35"},{"en":"37"}],"category":"Cricket","domain":"sports","topic":"Cricket","subtopic":"R Ashwin","difficulty":"extreme","files":["sports","cricket"],"correctIndex":3,"explanation":{"en":"He was ICC Cricketer of the Year in 2016, received the Padma Shri in January 2025 and retired from the IPL in August 2025."},"sourceUrl":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ravichandran_Ashwin"},{"id":"cr578","prompt":{"en":"Rohit Sharma's world-record ODI score of 264 at Eden Gardens in November 2014 came against which opponent?"},"options":[{"en":"Sri Lanka"},{"en":"West Indies"},{"en":"Australia"},{"en":"Bangladesh"}],"category":"Cricket","